  "body": "Welcome to a rare opportunity to secure your place in one of Auckland’s most desirable North Shore addresses. Nestled in the heart of family-friendly Torbay, these stunning, brand-new homes offer the perfect blend of modern luxury, comfort, and everyday convenience. Covered by 10-Year Master Build Guarantee for complete peace of mind!\r\n\r\nLot 1:\r\n— 4 spacious bedrooms\r\n— 3.5 bathrooms including 2 master ensuites\r\n— 171 m² of intelligently designed living space (approx.)\r\n— Secure single garage\r\n\r\nLot 2:\r\n— 4 generous bedrooms\r\n— 3.5 bathrooms including 2 master ensuites\r\n— Expansive 204 m² floor area (approx.)\r\n— Single garage for convenience\r\n\r\nLot 3:\r\n— 4 bedrooms plus a versatile study—ideal for remote work or homework\r\n— 3.5 bathrooms including 2 master ensuites\r\n— Impressive 212 m² floor area (approx.)\r\n— Single garage plus extra off-street parking\r\n\r\nImagine coming home to light-filled living areas, thoughtfully crafted interiors, and spaces that invite both relaxation and entertaining. Each home is designed with the modern family in mind, featuring open-plan layouts, quality finishes, and ample room to grow.\r\n\r\nStep outside and immerse yourself in Torbay’s renowned coastal lifestyle. Enjoy morning walks along golden beaches, weekends exploring local parks, and the peace of mind that comes with top-rated schools just moments away. With a warm, welcoming community and excellent amenities at your doorstep, every day feels like a holiday.\r\n\r\nWhether you’re upsizing, relocating, or searching for your forever home, these exceptional properties offer the ultimate combination of location, lifestyle, and luxury. Don’t miss your chance to secure a brand-new home in this thriving, high-demand neighbourhood.\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange a viewing and experience the Torbay difference for yourself. Your new beginning awaits!",
